        "referent_role": "third_person",
        "quote": "王玄載，字彥休，下邳人也。祖宰，偽北地太守。父蕤，東莞太守。",
        "note": "依本段敘事、稱謂及語者受者定。"
      },
      {
        "id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:p001:r0022",
        "paragraph_id": "c-nanqishu-027-wangxuanzai:p001",
